    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 1.5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he ðonne ful wurðe, æt ðæm forman cyrre bete ðam teonde twygylde ⁊ ðam hlaforde his were ⁊ sette getreowe borgas þæt he ælces yfel[es] eft geswice.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he is found guilty, on the first occasion he shall pay the accuser double value and his wergeld to his lord, and shall appoint trustworthy sureties that henceforth he will desist from every kind of misdeed.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he þonne ful wurðe, æt þæm forman cyrre bete þam teonde twygylde ⁊ þam hlaforde his were ⁊ sette getreowe borgas, þæt he ælces yfeles geswice eft.</ab>
      </div>
